  "title": "Slow Cooker Posole with Pork and Chicken",
  "description": "This traditional New Mexican food served especially during the Christmas holidays can be enjoyed throughout the year. This soup, which can be made a variety of ways, freezes well and definitely qualifies as a comfort food.",
